			"notes": "The editor update for Scaffold 0.4.0. See the core update here: https://github.com/Sam54123/Scaffold/releases/tag/0.4.0\n\nNote: levels that make use of `world_redstone_listener` are NOT backwards compatible. To update, replace all instances of `world_restone_listener` with `redstone_listener` using a text editor.\n\n**This build only runs on Windows! To use with other operating systems, you must build from source.**\n\nChange log:\n- Improved stability launching into editor.\n- Implemented \"Open in Game\" button.\n- Fixed potential crash when moving large block collections.\n- Overhauled outliner.\n- Fixed entity browser.\n- Overhauled resize tool.\n- Fixed resolution on editor close."
		},
